{
  "action": "After a standard system update you need to restart your session to make\nall the necessary changes.",
  "cves": [
    "CVE-2026-84267",
    "CVE-2026-84270",
    "CVE-2026-84269"
  ],
  "description": "It was discovered that GVfs did not properly validate data returned by\nan SFTP server. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to\nobtain sensitive information.\n(CVE-2026-84267)\n\nIt was discovered that GVfs did not properly validate the size of\nreplies from an AFP server. A remote attacker could possibly use this\nissue to cause a denial of service.\n(CVE-2026-84269)\n\nIt was discovered that GVfs did not properly validate the size of data\nreturned by an MTP device. An attacker with a malicious MTP device\ncould possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service.\n(CVE-2026-84270)",
  "id": "USN-8970-1",
  "isummary": "Several security issues were fixed in GVfs.",
